cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EIS Gold Studio in research, please cite this software release."
type: software
title: "EIS Gold Studio"
abstract: >-
  A desktop environment for auditable electrochemical impedance spectroscopy
  import, visualization, equivalent-circuit fitting, model comparison,
  distributed-process screening, Mott-Schottky analysis, paired analysis, and
  global fitting of DC-bias series.
